  "notes": [
    "Heavy Armour: Prevents arming bows and spears.",
    "Projectile Stagger Immunity: Does not get staggered by projectiles.",
    "Projectile Deflection: Can deflect Crude Shortbow Arrows , Shortbow Arrows , Longbow Arrows , and Javelin . Deflection chance is higher if projectiles are coming from in front.",
    "Piercing Vulnerability: Halves the total mitigation against Piercing damage type.",
    "Damage Mitigation",
    "Damage mitigation reduces the amount of taken damage. It is multiplicative and each quality level provides 10%, 20%, 30% additional damage mitigation over base damage mitigation respectively.",
    "Total damage mitigation is calculated following this formula:",
    "TotalDmgMit = 1 - (( 1 - (DmgMitA * QltyLvLMult) ) * ( 1 - (DmgMitB * QltyLvLMult) ) * ( 1 - (DmgMitC * QltyLvLMult) ))",
    "Stability Mitigation",
    "Stability mitigation reduces the stagger time while in combat. It is addictive and not affected by armour quality.",
    "Total stability mitigation is calculated following this formula:",
    "TotalStbMit = StbMitA + StbMitB + StbMitC",
    "Temperature Mitigation",
    "Temperature mitigation reduces the heat transfer amount per second, slowing both cooling down and heating up. Total temperature mitigation is addictive and not affected by armour quality.",
    "Total temperature mitigation is calculated following this formula:",
    "TotalTmpMit = TmpMitA + TmpMitB + TmpMitC"
  ]
}
